{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>יכרת ער ועונה</b> — for the reason of the matter: son and grandson. And Yefet said: as long as his soul remains, there will be to him ער ועונה, for his family was not cut off. And if the doer of this abomination — should the one who does it be a priest — he shall not have a son who offers a meal-offering."], :book :malachi, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Malachi -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/malachi"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:13:14.897255549Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}